  "title": "Faux-Chicken Stir-Fry",
  "description": "This easy vegan stir-fry is loaded with fresh veggies and plant-based &#34;chicken&#34; fillets. Serve it over hot steamed brown or white rice, or in iceberg lettuce leaves.",
